    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, i think there's a mistake there. you said \"CIF does not cover the goods during transit\" but isn't the \"I\" in CIF for Insurance? shouldn't the seller be providing that coverage for the transit part? and what did you mean by \"German MVL\"? i've never heard that term used in shipping before.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
